, commerce systems, mobile apps, print, digital signage, or headless consumers via REST and GraphQL. Pimcore Studio provides the unified administration interface for…"],"features":["Data Objects — manage any structured data based on a class-editor-defined model, either manually or via API.","Covers products (PIM/MDM), categories, customers (CDP), orders (Digital Commerce), and articles (DXP/CMS). Delivers consistent data to multiple output channels from a single source.","Assets (DAM) — store and manage any file type. Preview 200+ formats directly in Pimcore, auto-generate","channel-specific output formats, and enrich files with metadata and versioning.","Documents (DXP/CMS) — build pages with Twig templates and inline editables, with full multilingual and multi-site"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pimcore/pimcore/blob/2026.x/README.md","fingerprint":"20a9e7c8303eb897cb6877c11a86804b324403c5baa4c7e3daf30bbd3adf00cf","extractedAt":"2026-10-04T08:15:00.414Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:53.247Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"One platform. Any data. Any channel. Any process.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pimcore/pimcore/blob/2026.x/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"20a9e7c8303eb897cb6877c11a86804b324403c5baa4c7e3daf30bbd3adf00cf","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pimcore/pimcore/blob/2026.x/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:53.248Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T15:16:24Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pimcore/pimcore/blob/2026.x/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:53.249Z","hash":"20a9e7c8303eb897cb6877c11a86804b324403c5baa4c7e3daf30bbd3adf00cf","originalBytes":9421,"storedBytes":9421,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["pimcore","data","core","any","management","platform","open","digital","local","via","backend","cms","doc","docker","dxp","file","full","headless","img","installation","issues","module","platform.","rest","same","see","studio","sy